{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0314_1008_p", "source_sha256": "44a995866f7d536c4fcf7e09b65342b9db0389b0ced55feb7fab65695f38381a", "ja": "うーん……？　あ！\nもしかして、コンセプトってことか？", "zh": "嗯……？啊！\n难道说，是指概念？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
