{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0314_1010_p", "source_sha256": "260031519ceb3cd44cbb68c533cb926aa7a02345b00bbe01b0f8f25677b1e43f", "ja": "うん。その衣装のコンセプトは、『光』だ。\n夜空の星や、オーロラや……小さいけど、確かな光。", "zh": "嗯。这套服装的概念是“光”。\n夜空中的繁星，还有极光……虽然微小，却切实存在的光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
