{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0314_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "9b1aaf03b730b4f0ec95934159cc8e639389467a5ce6e31060db63716278cc0d", "ja": "あ、でも……だとしたらこれは、\n私だけの『光』ではないのだと思います。", "zh": "啊，不过……如果是这样的话，这应该就不只是属于我一个人的“光”了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0314_1014_p", "source_sha256": "417db7ad268f3246255185ff788a1f02de400148d7f92e3bbfd110b3af1d973f", "ja": "うん？　それは……？", "zh": "嗯？那是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
